---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Oxide-SEO - Technical SEO Simplified</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script is:inline>
      const theme = (() => {
        if (typeof localStorage !== 'undefined' && localStorage.getItem('starlight-theme')) {
          return localStorage.getItem('starlight-theme');
        }
        return window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light';
      })();
      document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);
    </script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-wiki-bg text-wiki-text min-h-screen text-sm md:text-base p-4 md:p-8 flex justify-center font-sans">
    
    <!-- Flat Depth Container -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl w-full bg-wiki-surface shadow-flat-depth rounded-lg overflow-hidden relative border border-wiki-border">
      
      <!-- Top Tabs / Navigation -->
      <nav class="flex border-b border-wiki-border bg-wiki-bg/50 text-sm">
        <div class="px-5 py-3 font-semibold bg-wiki-surface shadow-[0_1px_0_var(--color-wiki-surface)] z-10 text-wiki-text border-r border-wiki-border">Main Page</div>
        <a href="/guides/introduction" class="px-5 py-3 text-wiki-link hover:bg-wiki-bg/50 transition-colors border-r border-wiki-border">Documentation</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/chandranshB/Oxide-SEO" class="px-5 py-3 text-wiki-link hover:bg-wiki-bg/50 transition-colors">View source</a>
      </nav>

      <div class="p-8 md:p-12">
        <!-- Title -->
        <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-press-start border-b border-wiki-border pb-3 mb-8 tracking-tight flex items-center">
          <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-500">Ox</span>ide-SEO
        </h1>
        
        <!-- Infobox (Wikipedia design language component) -->
        <div class="float-right clear-right ml-8 mb-6 shadow-flat-depth rounded-md overflow-hidden bg-wiki-surface w-72 border border-wiki-border mt-1">
          <div class="p-4 flex justify-center items-center text-sm font-press-start bg-wiki-bg border-b border-wiki-border text-wiki-text tracking-tighter">
            <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-500">Ox</span><span>ide-SEO</span>
          </div>
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <tbody>
              <tr class="border-b border-wiki-border/50">
                <td class="p-3 font-medium text-wiki-text-muted bg-wiki-bg/30 w-1/3">Type</td>
                <td class="p-3">Desktop Software</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-wiki-border/50">
                <td class="p-3 font-medium text-wiki-text-muted bg-wiki-bg/30">Backend</td>
                <td class="p-3">Rust (Tauri)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-wiki-border/50">
                <td class="p-3 font-medium text-wiki-text-muted bg-wiki-bg/30">Frontend</td>
                <td class="p-3">React</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-medium text-wiki-text-muted bg-wiki-bg/30">License</td>
                <td class="p-3"><a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.en.html" class="text-wiki-link hover:underline font-semibold" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AGPL v3</a></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-lg text-wiki-text-muted">
          <strong class="text-wiki-text font-medium">Oxide-SEO</strong> is a fast, locally-run desktop application designed for technical <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Search_engine_optimization" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wiki-link hover:underline">search engine optimization</a> (SEO) audits and <a href="https://search.google.com/search-console/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wiki-link hover:underline">Google Search Console</a> data analysis. Unlike conventional cloud-based tools, it stores all data in a local SQLite database to bypass arbitrary API limits and subscription fees.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium border-b border-wiki-border pb-2 mt-12 mb-6 tracking-tight text-wiki-text">Core Capabilities</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-10">
          
          <div class="border border-wiki-border bg-wiki-bg/30 p-5 rounded-md hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-flat-depth transition-all duration-300">
            <h3 class="text-wiki-link font-medium mb-2">GSC Dashboard</h3>
            <p class="text-wiki-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Directly interface with the Google Search Console API and cache historical performance data without arbitrary limits.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-wiki-border bg-wiki-bg/30 p-5 rounded-md hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-flat-depth transition-all duration-300">
            <h3 class="text-wiki-link font-medium mb-2">Keyword Vault</h3>
            <p class="text-wiki-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Securely store and organize thousands of keywords to analyze intent, search volume, and ranking gaps locally.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-wiki-border bg-wiki-bg/30 p-5 rounded-md hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-flat-depth transition-all duration-300">
            <h3 class="text-wiki-link font-medium mb-2">Site Audit</h3>
            <p class="text-wiki-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Run a highly concurrent local crawler to discover broken links, analyze response codes, and flag missing meta tags instantly.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-wiki-border bg-wiki-bg/30 p-5 rounded-md hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-flat-depth transition-all duration-300">
            <h3 class="text-wiki-link font-medium mb-2">Competitor Analysis</h3>
            <p class="text-wiki-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Track competitors, monitor keyword overlaps, and identify strategic gaps directly from your desktop.</p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium border-b border-wiki-border pb-2 mt-12 mb-6 tracking-tight text-wiki-text">See also</h2>
        <ul class="list-none space-y-2 text-wiki-text-muted">
          <li><a href="/features/site-audit" class="text-wiki-link hover:underline">Web crawler algorithms</a></li>
          <li><a href="/features/gsc-dashboard" class="text-wiki-link hover:underline">Data caching mechanisms</a></li>
        </ul>

      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
